 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Esoteric Art — Cursed Technique Reversal</em></p><p>As an action for 4 CE, you force a creature within 30 ft that you can see to make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, they begin to lose definition for 1 minute. For the duration their body becomes blurred  and  their  appearance  is  almost  impossible  to  discern.  Both attacks  they make and attacks made against them are at disadvantage. Additionally, at the start of their turn you can force the target to take  necrotic  damage  equal  to  twice  your  level  and  reduce  its movement  speed  by  5  ft.  If  this  reduces  the target’s movement to 0, it  becomes  restrained  for  the  rest  of  the  duration as it melts into the environment.</p>",
